<title>USA: Carlstadt, N.J., $2 mln won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Carlstadt, N.J., $2 mln won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $2 million of Carlstadt, N.J., tax appeal refunding bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.15, highest price of 100.008.</p>
</text>
